  "body": "[The spec](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#the-formdataevent-interface):\r\n\r\n```webidl\r\n[Exposed=Window,\r\n Constructor(DOMString type, optional FormDataEventInit eventInitDict = {})]\r\ninterface FormDataEvent : Event {\r\n  readonly attribute FormData formData;\r\n};\r\n\r\ndictionary FormDataEventInit : EventInit {\r\n  required FormData formData;\r\n};\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt doesn't really make sense to mark `eventInitDict` as optional when real implementations require a value for the second argument, and the default empty dictionary value doesn't make sense either. This probably should be:\r\n\r\n```webidl\r\n[Exposed=Window]\r\ninterface FormDataEvent : Event {\r\n  constructor(DOMString type, FormDataEventInit eventInitDict);\r\n  readonly attribute FormData formData;\r\n};\r\n```\r\n\r\ncc @bzbarsky for https://github.com/heycam/webidl/issues/793 and https://github.com/immersive-web/webxr/pull/811#issuecomment-524913684.",
